usage: memory_tool [-h] {create,relocate,remove,mind_meld,promote} ...

Create and manage DIL memory notes.

positional arguments:
  {create,relocate,remove,mind_meld,promote}
    create              Create a new memory note
    relocate            Move a memory note between scopes
    remove              Retire, restore, prune, or permanently delete a memory
                        note
    mind_meld           Export a memory to the DIL template repo, generalized
                        and redacted
    promote             Copy files to the DIL template repo and optionally
                        commit/push

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
